  "prefLabel": "Env-Dw 708.12 Minimum Monitoring Requirements",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Dw 708.12 Minimum Monitoring Requirements. Minimum monitoring shall consist of:\n\n(a) Quarterly bacteriological analysis in accordance with Env-Dw 709;\n\n(b) Annual nitrate analysis in accordance with Env-Dw 711.18 through Env-Dw 711.23; and\n\n(c) Nitrite analysis every 3 years in accordance with Env-Dw 711.24 through Env-Dw 711.28.\n\nSource. #9700, eff 5-1-10; ss by #12667, eff 1-1-19",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-dw700.html"
}
